        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the next generation of heroes—&quot;Oracle,&quot; given to your mother and you for your ability to see glimpses into the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing that stands in your way of keeping peace in the city is the supervillain &quot;Chronos&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you aren't protecting the city from Chronos, you're just an average, everyday civilian working as a project manager with your long-time crush, Nikolaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little do you know that Nikolaos knows your secret, but you don't know his—that he and Chronos are one and the same.<br><br>Criminally Yours is a superhero-themed romance visual novel. You can romance a yandere supervillain or a tsundere superhero. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >71k words/7+ Hours Worth of Content (Full Nik Route)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renamable MC/Custom Pronouns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make over 50+ Choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 CGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Funky/Jazzy Soundtrack </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully Voice Acted!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Yandere Supervillain Love Interest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Tsundere Hero Love Interest</p></li></ul>",
